{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"mdeet-2021-chemistry-12","exam":"MDEET","year":2021,"subject":"chemistry","number":12,"points":5,"unitId":"thermo","unitLabel":"열역학·열화학","topic":"엔탈피·열화학·표준생성","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["thermo","stereo"],"stem":"그림은 298K에서 표준 생성 엔탈피(ΔHf\no)가 0인 Sn(s, 백주석)과 \nCl2(g)로부터 SnCl4(g)이 형성되는 과정과 표준 반응 엔탈피(ΔHo)를, \n표는 관련된 열화학 자료를 나타낸 것이다.\n표준 반응 엔탈피\n반응식\nΔHo(kJ)\nCl2(g)→2Cl(g)\n240\nSnCl4(g)→Sn(g)+4Cl(g)\n1250\nSn(s, 회주석) +Cl2(g)→SnCl2(s)\n−323\nSn(s, 백주석) →Sn(g)\n(가)\n298K 표준 상태에서 이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 \n있는 대로 고른 것은? [5점]\n<보 기>\nㄱ. SnCl4(l)의 ΔHf\no는 −510kJ/mol이다.\nㄴ. Sn(s, 회주석)의 ΔHf\no는 2kJ/mol이다.\nㄷ. (가)는 300이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03","fig-04","fig-05","fig-06"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t024"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t025"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t026"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t027"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t028"]}],"answer":3,"acceptedAnswers":[3],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":535,"height":32,"region":0,"bbox":[61.08,5.176,214.0,12.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t001","t002"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2021-chemistry-12/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":701,"height":37,"region":0,"bbox":[25.08,28.376,280.4,14.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2021-chemistry-12/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":608,"height":267,"region":0,"bbox":[48.28,79.576,243.2,106.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2021-chemistry-12/03.webp"},{"id":"fig-04","width":772,"height":322,"region":0,"bbox":[14.68,205.576,308.8,128.8],"role":"stem"